{"id":"b774ede033a2483d","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-pigeonhole-cnf.md","title":"鸽巢原理的 CNF 编码","display":"df-pigeonhole-cnf — 鸽巢原理的 CNF 编码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-pigeonhole-cnf","aliases":["28-df-pigeonhole-cnf"],"display":"df-pigeonhole-cnf — 鸽巢原理的 CNF 编码","depends_on":["[[28-df-clause]]","[[28-df-cnf]]","[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]"],"source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_printed_pages":"310","source_pdf_pages":"336"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-pigeonhole-cnf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-pigeonhole-cnf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pigeonhole-cnf — 鸽巢原理的 CNF 编码"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"af4c08adc4c81449\" href=\"?note=af4c08adc4c81449\" title=\"28-df-clause\">28-df-clause</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" href=\"?note=c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" title=\"28-df-cnf\">28-df-cnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"310"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"336"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropVar}\">\\(\\mathrm{PropVar}\\)</span> 为命题变量集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha\\)</span> 是 CNF 求值函数，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(m,n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{ij}\">\\(p_{ij}\\)</span> 为两两不同的命题变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\le i\\le m,1\\le j\\le n\">\\(1\\le i\\le m,1\\le j\\le n\\)</span>。子句/CNF 与求值来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"af4c08adc4c81449\" href=\"?note=af4c08adc4c81449\" title=\"28-df-clause\">28-df-clause</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" href=\"?note=c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" title=\"28-df-cnf\">28-df-cnf</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PHP}_{m,n}\\coloneqq\\{\\{p_{i1},\\ldots,p_{in}\\}\\mid1\\le i\\le m\\}\\cup\\{\\{\\neg p_{ij},\\neg p_{i&#39;j}\\}\\mid1\\le i&lt;i&#39;\\le m,\\ 1\\le j\\le n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PHP}_{m,n}\\coloneqq\\{\\{p_{i1},\\ldots,p_{in}\\}\\mid1\\le i\\le m\\}\\cup\\{\\{\\neg p_{ij},\\neg p_{i&#39;j}\\}\\mid1\\le i&lt;i&#39;\\le m,\\ 1\\le j\\le n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha(\\mathrm{PHP}_{m,n})=1\\Longleftrightarrow m\\le n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha(\\mathrm{PHP}_{m,n})=1\\Longleftrightarrow m\\le n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地 PHP 表示“存在一个不碰撞的安放”的 CNF，即原书记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{PHP}^{m}_{n}\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{PHP}^{m}_{n}\\)</span> 的不可满足公式。未加入每只鸽子至多选一个洞的子句：每只至少选一个且洞不共享已足以从满足赋值选出注入。反方向由任意注入赋值给出；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;n\">\\(m&gt;n\\)</span> 由有限鸽巢原理否定。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§15.2.1，印刷 p.310 / PDF p.336。已核对本项所述原文；集合/元组编码是本目录的显式实现约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"af4c08adc4c81449","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-clause]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"c8f19b1793fdfb6a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"2eb3efc252f058f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"2eb3efc252f058f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PropVar}$ 为命题变量集，$\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha$ 是 CNF 求值函数，see [[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"af4c08adc4c81449","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m,n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$p_{ij}$ 为两两不同的命题变量，$1\\le i\\le m,1\\le j\\le n$。子句/CNF 与求值来自 [[28-df-clause]]、[[28-df-cnf]]、[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"c8f19b1793fdfb6a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m,n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$p_{ij}$ 为两两不同的命题变量，$1\\le i\\le m,1\\le j\\le n$。子句/CNF 与求值来自 [[28-df-clause]]、[[28-df-cnf]]、[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"2eb3efc252f058f9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m,n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$p_{ij}$ 为两两不同的命题变量，$1\\le i\\le m,1\\le j\\le n$。子句/CNF 与求值来自 [[28-df-clause]]、[[28-df-cnf]]、[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PropVar}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"p_{ij}","display":false},{"tex":"1\\le i\\le m,1\\le j\\le n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PHP}_{m,n}\\coloneqq\\{\\{p_{i1},\\ldots,p_{in}\\}\\mid1\\le i\\le m\\}\\cup\\{\\{\\neg p_{ij},\\neg p_{i'j}\\}\\mid1\\le i<i'\\le m,\\ 1\\le j\\le n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha(\\mathrm{PHP}_{m,n})=1\\Longleftrightarrow m\\le n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{PHP}^{m}_{n}","display":false},{"tex":"m>n","display":false}],"bytes":1587,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-221","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第15章：证明复杂性：[[28-df-propositional-proof-system]]、[[28-thm-polynomial-proofs-np-conp]]、[[28-df-resolution]]、[[28-thm-resolution-soundness-completeness]]、[[28-df-pigeonhole-cnf]]、[[28-thm-pigeonhole-resolution-lower-bound]]。"},{"id":"46778a95d3c9618d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$N\\in\\mathbb N$，$N\\ge2$；$F=\\mathrm{PHP}_{N,N-1}$ 来自 [[28-df-pigeonhole-cnf]]。$\\operatorname{ResRef},|\\pi|_{\\mathrm{Res}}$ 来自 [[28-df-resolution]]。"}],"outgoing":["af4c08adc4c81449","c8f19b1793fdfb6a","2eb3efc252f058f9"]}